  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.04 Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.04 “Application” means the written document(s), with attachments, through which financial assistance is requested. The term includes the eligibility request and the final application.",
